{"id":"prakticheski","lemma":"практически","pos":"adv","rank":826,"glosses":["practically, in a practical manner","practically, virtually"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8e/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BA%D1%82%D0%B8%D1%87%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BA%D1%82%D0%B8%D1%87%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Мы практически семья.","en":"We're practically family.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"family"}]},{"text":"Он практически мертв.","en":"He is practically dead.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,null]},{"text":"Это практически невозможно.","en":"It's virtually impossible.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"it is impossible"}]},{"text":"Я делаю это практически каждый день.","en":"I do that almost every day.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"делать"},{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"every, each"},{"g":"day, daytime"}]},{"text":"Том приходит сюда практически каждый день.","en":"Tom comes here practically every day.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to come , to arrive","l":"приходить"},{"g":"here, hither"},null,{"g":"every, each"},{"g":"day, daytime"}]}]}